<section class="trust-strip"><div class="container"><span>Built around</span><strong>Clear information</strong><i></i><strong>Responsible processes</strong><i></i><strong>Legal awareness</strong></div></section>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE REFERENCE CATALOG</p><h2>Information, organized.</h2></div><a class="text-link" asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog">Browse sample catalog <span>→</span></a></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><a class="category-card" asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog"><span class="category-icon">01</span><h3>Handguns</h3><span>View sample records →</span></a></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><a class="category-card" asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog"><span class="category-icon">02</span><h3>Rifles</h3><span>View sample records →</span></a></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><a class="category-card" asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog"><span class="category-icon">03</span><h3>Shotguns</h3><span>View sample records →</span></a></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><a class="category-card" asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog"><span class="category-icon">04</span><h3>Historical items</h3><span>View sample records →</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="feature-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE PLATFORM, CLEARER PROCESSES</p><h2>Designed for responsible access.</h2></div><p>Explore the informational tools in this frontend demonstration. No account, application, or enquiry is permanently stored.</p></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">01 / REFERENCE</span><h3>Weapon information</h3><p>Review sample categories and general specifications with safety and legal context.</p><a asp-controller="Weapon" asp-action="Catalog">Explore catalog →</a></article></div><div class="col-md-4"><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">02 / ENQUIRIES</span><h3>Marketplace enquiries</h3><p>See how informational requests could be routed for administrative and legal review.</p><a asp-controller="Marketplace" asp-action="Index">View marketplace →</a></article></div><div class="col-md-4"><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">03 / GUIDANCE</span><h3>Licensing information</h3><p>Preview a general information request and sample application tracking statuses.</p><a asp-controller="Licensing" asp-action="Apply">View licensing →</a></article></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container process-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW ARMSGUARD WORKS</p><h2>A considered path, from information to review.</h2><p>ArmsGuard is designed to make processes easier to understand, while leaving decisions and approvals to the appropriate authorities.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" asp-controller="Licensing" asp-action="Tracking">See sample tracking</a></div><ol class="process-list"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Explore information</h3><p>Browse general reference records and safety notes.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Submit a demonstration enquiry</h3><p>Preview the form and review flow without storing data.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Consult official sources</h3><p>Verify laws, eligibility, and licensing with local authorities.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="safety-banner"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAFETY &amp; LEGAL AWARENESS</p><h2>Knowledge starts with responsibility.</h2><p>All content is illustrative. Laws differ by location. This platform does not issue licenses, sell items, or provide legal advice.</p></div><a asp-controller="Licensing" asp-action="Apply" class="btn btn-outline-light">Read licensing information</a></div></section>
